.TH DANBY-DOUBLEPENDULUM 1
.SH NAME
danby-doublependulum \- explore a nonlinear double pendulum
.SH DESCRIPTION
Two massive links obey the full coupled nonlinear equations.  The diagram
follows both bobs and the live plot compares their angles, revealing energy
exchange and sensitive chaotic motion.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps, R resets, and Q exits.
